"In her tutorial she finds a place where two dimensions bleed together and nearly dies there."
"A demon offers her a Rare class from the start if she will host it in her body."
"The demon is Zenith, and it breaks their bargain by trapping her in its bonefiend form."
"She finds the secret entrance to the Tower of Rizzen's basement."
"She becomes the bonefiend to kill the flesh-render matriarch in Blackmist Bog."
"She summons frostfury wasps, spear-tongue frogs, warrior roaches and a great eagle named Roc."
"Her favorite wasp is named Buzz, and two of her frogs are named Croak and Red."
"She uses beast cores in rituals that decide which summon she is offered next."
"She trains battlefield awareness for a month under Dira, a feathered rabbit summoner."
"Her aura strengthens the Strength, Dexterity and Toughness of every ally in range."
"After her evolution her summons grow personalities and memories of earlier incarnations."
"Her bonefiend form turns smaller and feminine, with magenta chitin, wrist-blades and a tail."
"She clears a five-star dungeon alone and wins Aurora a Rare building voucher."
"Zenith controls her body almost half the time after she returns to Earth."
"A tower reward grants her a consultation with Gella, an expert in sapient parasites."
"Gaia gives her a seed of power that sharpens her mind, her sense of self and her will."
"Whoever has the stronger will when her merger with Zenith completes keeps the body."
"She receives a Spatial Storage Rune on her body for fighting the Guardian."
"In her dreams she still looks human."
